  "stem": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">An egg is thrown from a rooftop. The equation <math alttext=\"h equals minus 4.9 t squared plus 9 t plus 18\"><mi>h</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>4.9</mn><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>9</mn><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>18</mn></math> represents this situation, where <math alttext=\"h\"><mi>h</mi>\n</math> is the height of the egg above the ground, in meters,<em> </em><math alttext=\"t\"><mi>t</mi>\n</math> seconds after it is thrown. According to the equation, what is the height, in meters, from which the egg was thrown?</p>",
