  "rationale": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">The correct answer is <math alttext=\"18\"><mn>18</mn>\n</math>. It's given that an egg is thrown from a rooftop and that the equation <math alttext=\"h equals minus 4.9 t squared plus 9 t plus 18\"><mi>h</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>4.9</mn><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>9</mn><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>18</mn></math> represents this situation, where <math alttext=\"h\"><mi>h</mi>\n</math> is the height of the egg above the ground, in meters, <math alttext=\"t\"><mi>t</mi>\n</math> seconds after it is thrown. If follows that the height, in meters, from which the egg was thrown is the value of <math alttext=\"h\"><mi>h</mi>\n</math> when <math alttext=\"t equals 0\"><mrow>\n\t<mi>t</mi>\n\t<mo>=</mo>\n\t<mn>0</mn>\n</mrow>\n</math>. Substituting <math alttext=\"0\"><mn>0</mn>\n</math> for <math alttext=\"t\"><mi>t</mi>\n</math> in the equation&nbsp;<math alttext=\"h equals minus 4.9 t squared plus 9 t plus 18\"><mi>h</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>4.9</mn><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>9</mn><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>18</mn></math> yields <math alttext=\"h left parenthesis 0 right parenthesis equals minus 4.9 left parenthesis 0 right parenthesis squared plus 9 left parenthesis 0 right parenthesis plus 18\"><mi>h</mi><mfenced><mn>0</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>4.9</mn><msup><mfenced><mn>0</mn></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>9</mn><mfenced><mn>0</mn></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>18</mn></math>, or <math alttext=\"h equals 18\"><mrow>\n\t<mi>h</mi>\n\t<mo>=</mo>\n\t<mn>18</mn>\n</mrow>\n</math>. Therefore, according to the equation, the height, in meters, from which the egg was thrown is <math alttext=\"18\"><mn>18</mn>\n</math>.</p>",
